      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated US OSHA Workplace Safety & Violation Compliance Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nAudits U.S. industrial, construction, and logistics establishments against OSHA enforcement inspections, citations (Willful, Repeat, Serious), financial penalties in USD, NAICS codes, and computes a Workplace Safety Risk Score (0-100).\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/us-osha-workplace-safety-violation-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-osha-workplace-safety-violation-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: us-osha-workplace-safety-violation-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9072a1f5-fbcd-512d-9ec7-721720a38df3",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
